    "describe_ch": "本課程授課內容主要在於幫助學生從最基本的光學出發來了解光電子相關之學識課程。並結合電磁學的概念來授與學生如何將分辨其與光學的差異與相識之處。",
    "describe_eh": "Review of basic EM theory and concept of linear system pertinent to photonics basic principles of scalar EM wave characteristics, propagation, and optical wave phenomena including interference.",
